@startuml credit-scoring
' NON-COMPLIANT on purpose. Deliberate defect:
'   - RiskEngine is a <<gateway>> here and a <<service>> in credit-decision.puml:
'     one system, two descriptions (XD002, reported on both files)
title Credit scoring
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-103

participant CreditOfficer
participant RiskEngine <<gateway>>
participant CreditBureau

CreditOfficer -> RiskEngine : scoreApplicant()
RiskEngine -> CreditBureau : fetchCreditReport()
CreditBureau --> RiskEngine : creditReport
RiskEngine --> CreditOfficer : score
@enduml
